==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fr|en}} {{m|fr|rapidité}}

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun|~|rapidities}}

# [[speed]], [[swiftness]]; the condition of being [[rapid]]
# {{lb|en|physics}} A measure of [[velocity]] relative to the [[speed of light]]
# {{lb|en|physics}} A measure of the velocity of a [[particle]] in a [[beam]] relative to the beam's [[axis]]

